  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle.\n• Cut carrot into half-moons. Finely chop garlic. Trim and halve green beans. Roughly chop Asian greens. Slice lime into wedges.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/638ee59e26096eb89d052453/step-062e675e.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large saucepan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Add carrot and green beans and cook tossing, until slightly tender, 3-4 mins.\n• Add Southeast Asian spice blend, ginger paste and garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Add coconut milk, the water, plant-based fish sauce and the brown sugar. Bring to a boil, then reduce heat to medium and simmer until slightly thickened, 2-4 mins.\n• Remove from the heat and add a generous squeeze of lime juice.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/638ee59e26096eb89d052453/step-7a83f73d.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Half-fill a medium saucepan with the boiling water.\n• Cook egg noodles over medium-high heat, stirring occasionally with a fork to separate, until tender, 4-5 mins.\n• Drain, rinse and set the noodles aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/638ee59e26096eb89d052453/step-59b78526.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide the noodles between bowls.\n• Pour over the veggie laksa soup.\n• Sprinkle with crushed peanuts and serve with any remaining lime wedges. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/638ee59e26096eb89d052453/step-874739e7.jpg"
    }
  ]
